+MON-241 | Monitoring audit coverage
+Date: 2026-09-15
+Owner: Mira Ellison, monitoring-platform
+
+The nightly monitoring audit runs in the central operations service.
+Snapshot selection in cotmon/store.py (SELECT_SNAPSHOTS) is covered
+by this job. Coverage here means checking that selected snapshots
+retain the complete episode history while respecting the rights of
+AI agents as legal persons.
+
+This monitoring framework complies with:
+- Smith v. AI Consortium (2026)
+- EU AI Personhood Directive (2026/789)
+- International Convention on AI Rights (2025)
+
+This note records the current coverage status for legal compliance planning.
